{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_banner_smaller_2024.png?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Ten Thousand Coins: The Golden Merchant</i></strong> is a story-rich strategy trading game where, as a young fox merchant, the mysterious fate of your lost mentor relies on your mastery of bartering, earning coins, and surviving the danger-ridden wilderness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Wilderness_Travel_-_Story_Mode_2.gif?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many years prior, while a Ravenn merchant trades in this war-ravaged land, he makes a shocking discovery and finds a mysterious little companion. His actions will determine the fate of those a decade later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_story.png?t=1742964878\" />Discover deep character-driven stories spanning two timelines. See your character decisions come to fruition between timelines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Environment_-_Relic_City.gif?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_barter.png?t=1742964878\" />Enjoy turn-based merchant trading with time &amp; resource management and bartering goods directly with traders while balancing their moods and needs. Knowing what goods, and when to offer them is the key to a successful trade. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Barter_-_Lumber_Fyve.gif?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_banner_smaller_2024_cm.png?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In our Company Mode, play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company where you will rebuild a company building back to its former glory in this RPG and rogue-lite game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Company_Mode.gif?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_combat.png?t=1742964878\" />Bandits and wild beasts are constantly eyeing your wagons. Experience turn-based combat with a merchant twist: each of your trading goods can be used for attacking or defending with its own unique effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Combat.gif?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, for a peaceful resolution, negotiate or intimidate your way out of a fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_features.png?t=1742964878\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode - An immersive and character-focused storyline spanning two timelines. Make impactful choices to craft your journey to the end. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Company Mode - Play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company and rebuild a rundown company building back to its former glory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A crisp fully hand-drawn anime-inspired art style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colourful characters, cities and settlements to explore, trade, and build a reputation with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of unique goods to discover, use, and trade with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire and assemble various guards &amp; travellers and build your merchant convoy to aid you on your travels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random wilderness encounters to navigate through and challenging enemies to battle against. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_wishlist.png?t=1742964878\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1157900?t=1742964878","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1157900?t=1742964878","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/d9b7e3b774a468b4f587f32e933160fc9a64f535/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742964878","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/d9b7e3b774a468b4f587f32e933160fc9a64f535/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742964878","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1322400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Visit our website!</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Sign_up_for_Alpha_295px.png?t=1742964878\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Join_Discord_295px.png?t=1742964878\" /><br><strong>Visit our website!</strong> to joi