 balancing their moods and needs. Knowing what goods, and when to offer them is the key to a successful trade. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Barter_-_Lumber_Fyve.gif?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_banner_smaller_2024_cm.png?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In our Company Mode, play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company where you will rebuild a company building back to its former glory in this RPG and rogue-lite game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Company_Mode.gif?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_combat.png?t=1742964878\" />Bandits and wild beasts are constantly eyeing your wagons. Experience turn-based combat with a merchant twist: each of your trading goods can be used for attacking or defending with its own unique effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Combat.gif?t=1742964878\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, for a peaceful resolution, negotiate or intimidate your way out of a fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_features.png?t=1742964878\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode - An immersive and character-focused storyline spanning two timelines. Make impactful choices to craft your journey to the end. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Company Mode - Play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company and rebuild a rundown company building back to its former glory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A crisp fully hand-drawn anime-inspired art style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colourful characters, cities and settlements to explore, trade, and build a reputation with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of unique goods to discover, use, and trade with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire and assemble various guards &amp; travellers and build your merchant convoy to aid you on your travels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random wilderness encounters to navigate through and challenging enemies to battle against. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_wishlist.png?t=1742964878\" /></p>","developers":["Thousand Tonic"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/header.jpg?t=1742964878","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257021848,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257021848/movie480.mp4?t=1715238567","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257021848/movie_max.mp4?t=1715238567"},"name":"Ten Thousand Coins: The Golden Merchant - Alpha Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257021848/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1715238567","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257021848/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1715238567","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257021848/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1715238567"}}],"name":"Te